71079,-0.03620902,-0.00974049,0.02308972,0.03478191,0.01272404,-0.28122565,-0.0097802,-0.00670244,0.02052767,0.02089506,-0.03329798,0.06510432,-0.02087538,-0.0258656,0.0260492,0.00321434,0.06192175,0.02127632,0.01249761,-0.0153853,0.01030369,0.11270949,-0.01245607,0.05141386,-0.04402816,0.04074335,0.07068276,0.18572025,0.03848689,0.05088133,0.03563089,-0.05879758,0.01735163,0.09009464,0.01811998,0.04005295,-0.03723482,0.109909,0.01724924,0.0346533,0.08250886,-0.03000893,0.03832169,0.02085312,-0.00041035,0.00671533,0.01116939,-0.01228448,-0.01976165,0.09029208,0.00548732,-0.02239566,-0.11771336,-0.02823133,0.01080785,-0.04424529,0.01089432,-0.05114287,0.03865779,-0.00033747,0.0454843,0.00979538,-0.01086362,-0.05092346,-0.0053992,-0.05452899,-0.06152986,0.0359791,0.08647445,-0.03453429],"last_embed":{"tokens":454,"hash":"1dgphmy"}}},"last_read":{"hash":"1dgphmy","at":1779619527330},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776569697891,"size":105489,"at":1779618268778,"hash":"1dgphmy"},"blocks":{"##Language / Execution model":[1,3],"##Language / Execution model#{1}":[2,3],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)":[4,629],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#{1}":[5,5],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#Pine Script® relies on an event-driven, sequential execution model to control how a script’s compiled source code runs in charts, [alerts], [Deep Backtesting] mode, and the [Pine Screener].":[6,6],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#In contrast to the traditional execution model of most programming languages, Pine’s runtime system executes a script _repeatedly_ on the sequence of _historical bars_ and _realtime ticks_ in the dataset on which it runs, performing _separate_ calculations for _each bar_ as it progresses. After each execution on a closed bar, the necessary data from that execution becomes part of an internal [time series] , and the script can use that data in its calculations on subsequent bars.":[7,13],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#In contrast to the traditional execution model of most programming languages, Pine’s runtime system executes a script _repeatedly_ on the sequence of _historical bars_ and _realtime ticks_ in the dataset on which it runs, performing _separate_ calculations for _each bar_ as it progresses. After each execution on a closed bar, the necessary data from that execution becomes part of an internal [time series] , and the script can use that data in its calculations on subsequent bars.#{1}":[8,13],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Bar-by-bar execution](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#bar-by-bar-execution)":[14,69],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Bar-by-bar execution](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#bar-by-bar-execution)#{1}":[15,28],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Bar-by-bar execution](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#bar-by-bar-execution)#{2}":[29,29],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Bar-by-bar execution](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#bar-by-bar-execution)#{3}":[30,30],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Bar-by-bar execution](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#bar-by-bar-execution)#{4}":[31,69],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Storing and using data from previous bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#storing-and-using-data-from-previous-bars)":[70,90],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Storing and using data from previous bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#storing-and-using-data-from-previous-bars)#{1}":[71,71],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Storing and using data from previous bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#storing-and-using-data-from-previous-bars)#{2}":[72,72],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Storing and using data from previous bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#storing-and-using-data-from-previous-bars)#{3}":[73,73],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Storing and using data from previous bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#storing-and-using-data-from-previous-bars)#{4}":[74,89],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Storing and using data from previous bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#storing-and-using-data-from-previous-bars)#{5}":[90,90],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Realtime bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#realtime-bars)":[91,124],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Realtime bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#realtime-bars)#{1}":[92,118],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Realtime bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#realtime-bars)#{2}":[119,119],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Realtime bars](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#realtime-bars)#{3}":[120,120],"##[Introduction](https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/language#introduction)#[Realtime bars](https:/